1
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Console Wars is a documentary film directed by Blake J. Harris.

2
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:30,000
In 1990, SEGA, a fledgling arcade company assembled a team of misfits to take
on the greatest video game company in the world, Nintendo.

3
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:42,000
It was a once-in-a-lifetime, no-holds-barred conflict that pit brother against brother, kids against grownups,
Sonic against Mario, and uniquely American capitalism against centuries-old Japanese tradition.

4
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:54,000
For the first time ever, the men and women who fought on the front lines for
Sega and Nintendo discuss this battle that defined a generation.

